    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>encrypted_nightmares</strong> is a horror game where you control a live dark web broadcast, switching between cameras to capture the most intense moments. Keep your audience hooked\u2014and donating\u2014by showing them the horrors they crave. Stay cold-hearted, chase the fear, and earn as many crypto coins as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/84eb46970302142f6bc320c9c157834a.poster.avif?t=1744721967\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/84eb46970302142f6bc320c9c157834a.webm?t=1744721967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/84eb46970302142f6bc320c9c157834a.mp4?t=1744721967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character of the live-stream show wakes up in a dark bunker with no memory of how he got there. Desperate to escape, he soon realises he's not alone\u2014something is lurking in the shadows, and countless eyes are watching his every move. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/3163162d90c7ff8afa7fe28f08091e94.poster.avif?t=1744721967\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/3163162d90c7ff8afa7fe28f08091e94.webm?t=1744721967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576980/extras/3163162d90c7ff8afa7fe28f08091e94.mp4?t=1744721967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>An average play through takes around <strong>40 minutes</strong> and is intended to be played in one sitting. With full control over what\u2019s shown on the cameras, no two runs are the same\u2014and you won\u2019t uncover everything in just one play through.<br><br><strong>Main features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control a live broadcast by switching between nine cameras.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn coins and viewers by showcasing the best moments.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Create your own story by showing what you want.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monitor different locations simultaneously, testing your multitasking skills.</i> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by found footage and screen-life films, this game largely reflects the experience of those genres.</p>",
